  // ---- CONFIGURATION PANEL (RuneLite's plugin list) -----------------------------------------------------
  // Opens LEFT of the 31px toolbar when the Configuration sidebar button is clicked: 242px wide, from under
  // the title bar to the bottom. Entry metrics are Jubel's, exactly: each row is 215x20 with 5px between
  // rows, split into a 21x20 favourite star, a 144x20 name, a 25x20 settings cog and a 25x20 switch.
  // THE CHROME MUST EAT ITS OWN MOUSE EVENTS. The game reads the mouse from window-level 'mousedown' /
  // 'mouseup' / 'wheel' listeners (see updateMouse), which sit in the BUBBLE phase -- so an event that
  // reaches window from anywhere in the DOM is treated as a click on the world. Individual chrome BUTTONS
  // already stopped propagation one by one, but their containers never did, so every click on a panel's
  // background, on a plugin entry, on the notice text, on the empty part of the toolbar -- anything that
  // was not itself a button -- fell straight through and registered as a click-to-move underneath.
