  // the EXACT RS MidiPcmStream synth (jagexsynth.js / window.JAGEXMIDI). It plays
  // EVERY track -- classic 2004 region music, the r474 music player, jingles, title
  // -- not just the OSRS-arrangement overrides; the flag also gates those overrides.
  // Set the flag false to fall back to the SF2 approximation (window.MIDI / basilmidi).
